      "text": "Memantine:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " start 5 mg once daily, then raise in 5 mg steps to 20 mg/day (10 mg twice daily). Severe renal impairment (CrCl 5 to 29 mL/min): target 5 mg twice daily."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
