    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Alkaline urine (pH 8) cut memantine clearance by about 80%, so urine-alkalinizing drugs or diet may cause accumulation and more adverse effects. Use other NMDA antagonists (amantadine, ketamine, dextromethorphan) with caution."
     }
    ]
   }
